<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.58 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.58 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 7.58 percent in the week ending December 21 from 7.08 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Dec 21, 1996  Dec 14, 1996  Dec 23, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.58	   +7.08	   +6.00</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  319.5	   319.0	   297.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended Dec 23, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
